      "content": "The pain you feel about life not making sense is real, but stopping your pain will not make life impossible or leave you alone forever. Even if your current path feels trapped in a crash loop, there is always the possibility to reboot your brain and start over with a completely different operating system of well-being. Please reach out to a suicide prevention hotline immediately; they are here to help you turn off this emotional program in a safe way rather than ending it all.",
      "source": "target",
